<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 8.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 8.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   94/98     99/100    UNQ    151/155</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  98/100   101/104  160/163  170/172</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - Bunker prices rose in line with cargo quotes but demand was very thin, traders said on Tuesday. They said margins in the bunker market is currently very thin with the cargo market looking more attractive to fuel oil sellers. Others said Singapore bunker market is overpriced.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
